  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilience and Improving Institutional Capacity in Indian Ocean Island States for Disaster Risk Reduction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;UNDRR will support the Island States of the Indian Ocean (Comoros, Madagascar, Mauritius, Seychelles) to strengthen their capacity for evidenced-based understanding of Disaster Risks and to improve disaster risk preparedness and governance, including policies and legal frameworks, the preparation of mechanisms and actions to reduce damages.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
